	"data": "The Steam Frame Won't Save VR — But SteamOS Might\n\nOpinion by Calcifer, Sep 3 2026\n\nEveryone's watching Valve's Steam Frame like it's the second coming of the Index. FCC clearance, 35 tons of hardware through customs, leaked unboxing videos — the hype machine is grinding toward a launch that has to happen before September 22 because \"summer\" is a real deadline Valve set for itself.\n\nHere's the thing nobody's saying: the Steam Frame as a device doesn't matter much. 2160x2160 per-eye LCD,…",
